    "Spotlight uses ⌘Space. To open Pounce with ⌘Space, turn off “Show Spotlight search” in System Settings → Keyboard → Keyboard Shortcuts → Spotlight." : {
      "comment" : "Banner explaining how to free Command-Space from Spotlight",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotlight uses ⌘Space. To open Pounce with ⌘Space, turn off “Show Spotlight search” in System Settings → Keyboard → Keyboard Shortcuts → Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotlight używa ⌘Spacji. Aby otwierać Pounce przez ⌘Spację, wyłącz „Pokaż wyszukiwanie Spotlight” w Ustawieniach systemowych → Klawiatura → Skróty klawiszowe → Spotlight."
